The Minix 2.0.4 manual pages, /usr/man of the SD root (Makefile:
boot/manproto).

Source: https://github.com/davidgiven/minix2, minix-2.0/fs/usr/man, commit
826a75d9e62686af19cb67e0261e5a63206146d8 (the 2.0.4 release, extracted).
The page names match psman/ of the official 2.0.4 tree
(ftp.cs.vu.nl/minix/2.0.4, mirrored at rsync.nic.funet.fi).  The files are
unchanged, except for these rosco additions:

	man1/asktime.1	rosco's boot-time clock prompt (cmds/asktime.c)
	man1/gzip.1	from gzip 1.2.4 (../gzip-1.2.4), without .PU and with
			[\fB\-S\fP \fIsuffix\fP] for .RB [ \-S\ suffix ],
			which cawf can't handle
	whatis		the lines for asktime and gzip, in makewhatis order

The pages cover all of Minix 2.0.4, also commands that the rosco image
does not have.  macros.9 and template.1 are not installed.
